{"id":"ganas","lemma":"ganas","pos":"noun","rank":820,"glosses":["desire, wish, want","enthusiasm","lust (chiefly when preceded by compound verb traerle o tener)"],"ipa":"/ˈɡanas/","gender":"f","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-ganas.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Cómo te ganas la vida?","en":"How do you earn your living?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/944413","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"you"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"the game"]]},{"text":"Vale, tú ganas.","en":"OK, you win.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1198065","words":[{"g":"a voucher"},{"g":"you"},null]},{"text":"Se me fueron las ganas de comer.","en":"I've lost my appetite.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/455246","words":[{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to eat"}]},{"text":"Yo no tengo ganas de hablar.","en":"I don't feel like talking anymore.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/522111","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to talk"}]},{"text":"A veces tengo ganas de dejar mi trabajo.","en":"At times I feel like quitting my job.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687908","words":[null,null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to leave"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"work, job"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"sometimes"]]}]}